{"seq":3,"slug":"science-modeling","title":"理科方向 理科综合 — 科学建模","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/science-comprehensive/interdisciplinary/science-modeling","wordCount":2192,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"理科方向-理科综合-科学建模\">理科方向 理科综合 — 科学建模</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>科学建模是理科综合能力的核心体现，指将复杂的自然现象抽象为可分析、可预测的数学或物理模型的过程。科学建模贯穿物理、化学、生物各学科，是科学研究方法论的集中体现。</p>\n<p>核心建模方法与类型包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>数学建模</strong>：用数学语言（方程、函数、不等式）描述自然规律。如牛顿第二定律 F = ma 将力、质量、加速度三者联系起来；理想气体状态方程 PV = nRT 将宏观状态量统一描述。</li>\n<li><strong>物理模型</strong>：对真实物体或系统进行理想化处理。质点模型忽略物体的形状和大小，弹簧振子模型忽略摩擦和空气阻力，理想气体模型忽略分子间作用力和分子体积。</li>\n<li><strong>概念模型</strong>：用图形、流程图或逻辑关系表示系统结构和过程。如生态系统的能量流动模型、细胞信号转导通路图、化学反应的能量曲线图。</li>\n<li><strong>计算模型</strong>：利用计算机模拟复杂系统的行为。如分子动力学模拟、种群增长的数值模拟、气候变化的全球环流模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"物理学中的建模思想\">物理学中的建模思想</h3><p>物理建模的第一步是确定研究对象并进行合理简化。以抛体运动为例，将运动物体简化为质点、忽略空气阻力后，抛体运动可以分解为水平方向的匀速直线运动和竖直方向的匀加速直线运动，从而用两个简单的运动方程完全描述轨迹：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x = v_0 \\cos\\theta \\times t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>\n<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>g</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = v_0 \\sin\\theta \\times t - (1/2)gt^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>消去时间参数 t，得到抛物线方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>g</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = x\\tan\\theta - gx^2/(2v_0^2\\cos^2\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">tan</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。模型的预测结果（射程、最大高度）可以与实验测量值对比，偏差的大小反映了忽略空气阻力这一假设的合理程度。</p>\n<p>当需要考虑空气阻力时，阻力通常建模为 f = −bv（低速）或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f = -cv^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（高速），此时微分方程无法解析求解，需要借助数值方法（欧拉法或龙格-库塔法）进行计算机模拟。这体现了从简单模型到复杂模型的递进过程。</p>\n<p>在电磁学中，点电荷模型、匀强电场模型、理想导体模型等都是典型的物理理想化。例如平行板电容器模型假设极板面积无穷大，忽略边缘效应，得到匀强电场 E = U/d 的简洁表达式。工程应用中需要修正这些理想化假设。</p>\n<h3 id=\"化学中的建模方法\">化学中的建模方法</h3><p>化学建模从原子模型的演变中可见一斑。道尔顿的实心球模型→汤姆逊的葡萄干蛋糕模型→卢瑟福的行星模型→玻尔的量子化轨道模型→量子力学的电子云模型，每一次模型更新都是对实验事实更精确的解释。</p>\n<p>化学平衡模型是高中化学的重要建模案例。对于可逆反应 aA + bB ⇌ cC + dD，平衡常数表达式 K = [C]^c[D]^d / [A]^a[B]^b 是一个定量模型，它允许我们预测浓度变化、温度变化、压强变化对平衡位置的影响（勒沙特列原理的定量版本）。</p>\n<p>化学反应速率模型同样体现了建模思想。简单的碰撞理论模型假设反应发生需要两个条件：分子碰撞且碰撞能量超过活化能。这个模型能定性解释温度和浓度对反应速率的影响，但无法解释空间取向效应，因此需要过渡态理论这个更精细的模型来补充。</p>\n<h3 id=\"生物学中的数学建模\">生物学中的数学建模</h3><p>种群增长模型是生物学数学建模的经典案例。理想条件下种群按指数增长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(t) = N_0 e^{rt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9436em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（J 型曲线），考虑环境容纳量 K 后变为逻辑斯蒂增长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dN/dt = rN(1-N/K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（S 型曲线）。两个模型的对比揭示了环境阻力对种群调控的作用。</p>\n<p>酶促反应的米氏模型 v = V_max[S]/(K_m+[S]) 是生物化学中最重要的数学模型之一。该模型基于稳态假设（酶-底物复合物浓度保持恒定），将复杂的酶催化机制简化为两个参数（V_max 和 K_m）的函数关系。</p>\n<p>神经冲动传导可以建模为 Hodgkin-Huxley 模型，用电路元件（电容、可变电阻、电池）类比细胞膜的电学性质。该模型用四个耦合的常微分方程描述动作电位的产生和传播，获得了 1963 年诺贝尔生理学或医学奖。</p>\n<h3 id=\"建模的一般流程\">建模的一般流程</h3><p>科学建模遵循&quot;观察→假设→数学化→预测→验证→修正&quot;的循环过程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>观察现象，提出问题</li>\n<li>分析变量，确定核心因素</li>\n<li>建立假设，进行合理简化</li>\n<li>用数学语言表达假设（建立方程）</li>\n<li>求解方程，得出预测</li>\n<li>用实验或观测数据验证预测</li>\n<li>根据偏差修正模型或扩展假设</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一个小球从高度 h 自由落体。建立忽略空气阻力的简单模型，推导落地速度和落地时间的表达式。然后考虑与速度成正比的空气阻力 f = −bv，写出运动方程并定性分析终端速度的概念。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某湖泊中鱼类种群的初始数量为 1000 尾，环境容纳量为 10000 尾，内禀增长率为 0.5/年。使用逻辑斯蒂增长模型计算 5 年后的种群数量。讨论何时种群增长速率最大。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在化学反应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>NO</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mtext>NO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{NO} + \\text{O}_2 \\to 2\\text{NO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中，实验测得反应速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>NO</mtext><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = k[\\text{NO}]^2[\\text{O}_2]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NO</span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。建立碰撞模型解释为什么速率方程中 [NO] 的指数为 2。讨论该速率方程暗示的反应机理。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较物理学中的理想气体模型和范德瓦尔斯模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(P + a/V^2)(V - b) = RT</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>。两个模型分别忽略和考虑了哪些因素？在什么条件下两者的差异最大？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>科学建模在现代研究中已经发展为独立的方法论体系。系统生物学利用常微分方程组建模基因调控网络和代谢网络，通过计算机模拟预测细胞对药物的响应。气候科学的全球环流模型（GCM）将大气分为三维网格，在每个网格点上求解流体力学方程（Navier-Stokes 方程），模拟全球气候变化趋势。</p>\n<p>在竞赛和自主招生中，建模能力是重要的考察维度。国际数学建模挑战赛（IMMC）和全国高中数学联赛中，建模类问题要求考生将实际问题转化为数学问题并求解。建议同学们练习《数学建模》入门教材中的经典案例，培养将自然语言翻译为数学语言的能力。</p>\n<p>机器学习可以被视为数据驱动的建模方法：给定输入-输出数据对，算法自动寻找最优的函数映射关系。与传统的物理建模（机理驱动）形成互补，在蛋白质折叠预测等复杂问题上展现出强大的建模能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-相关文档\">本 hub 相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../experimental-design/data-analysis\">数据分析</a>（本 hub 兄弟篇）——建模流程第 6 步&quot;用实验或观测数据验证预测&quot;落到操作层面就是图象法、线性化与最小二乘拟合，两篇合起来才是完整的&quot;建模—验证&quot;闭环。</li>\n<li><a href=\"bio-chemistry\">生物化学交叉</a>（本 hub 兄弟篇）——正文引用的米氏模型在那一篇有完整的生化语境（V_max 与 K_m 的物理含义、竞争性与非竞争性抑制），是&quot;数学模型服务具体学科&quot;的最佳实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>科学建模是理科综合能力的集中体现。通过将复杂现象简化为可处理的模型，我们能够进行定量预测和系统分析。物理的理想化模型、化学的反应机理模型、生物的种群动力学模型，虽然形式各异，但都遵循相同的建模方法论。掌握建模思想和流程，不仅是理科综合考试的得分利器，更是未来从事科学研究和工程实践的核心技能。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"理科方向 理科综合 — 科学建模","id":"理科方向-理科综合-科学建模"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"物理学中的建模思想","id":"物理学中的建模思想"},{"level":3,"text":"化学中的建模方法","id":"化学中的建模方法"},{"level":3,"text":"生物学中的数学建模","id":"生物学中的数学建模"},{"level":3,"text":"建模的一般流程","id":"建模的一般流程"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"本 hub 相关文档","id":"本-hub-相关文档"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"理科方向 理科综合 — 生物化学交叉","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/science-comprehensive/interdisciplinary/bio-chemistry"},"next":{"title":"理科方向 理科综合 — 控制变量法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/science-comprehensive/experimental-design/control-variables"}}